      "content": "SP 80 SE                          GREAT MISSENDEN         MAPRIDGE GREEN LANE 1/88                                                           Rignalls II 1909 Adams and Holden architects.  Rendered, tiled roof, brick chimneys.  Two storeys and attic, three large tile hung gables to south front, each with a 4-light casement to the attic.  Two storey canted bay window on left with transomed window to ground floor.  Single storey canted bay window on right.  Four and 5-light casements to first floor. Listing NGR: SP8808802348"
    }
